1
00:00:00,166 --> 00:00:01,751
My name is Jaiprakash Chauhan.

2
00:00:02,210 --> 00:00:06,339
And I am from...Uttarakhand.

3
00:00:06,923 --> 00:00:09,467
My village is 200 km away from Dehradun...

4
00:00:09,843 --> 00:00:12,804
And I am from Uttarkashi...

5
00:00:13,847 --> 00:00:14,973
..and village Kiranu.

6
00:00:15,765 --> 00:00:18,685
There is no such problem in our village.

7
00:00:18,685 --> 00:00:23,314
But now in every village... I mean, in every house we have roads, right?

8
00:00:23,857 --> 00:00:26,151
There is no such problem.

9
00:00:26,901 --> 00:00:28,236
Someone is paying attention

10
00:00:29,154 --> 00:00:30,989
So we get to know about (government schemes).

11
00:00:32,657 --> 00:00:35,034
Ration card,...whatever...

12
00:00:35,034 --> 00:00:38,121
So...means, there is the village head, he gives it.

13
00:00:38,872 --> 00:00:41,040
He was the village headman, he said

14
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:44,711
that everyone needs an Aadhar card.

15
00:00:44,919 --> 00:00:48,047
(he) asked to gather in one place, in one place..so...

16
00:00:48,047 --> 00:00:51,176
He became the village head through election.

17
00:00:51,176 --> 00:00:51,801
The election was held...

18
00:00:52,427 --> 00:00:57,932
And voting is done for them...voting is done.

19
00:00:58,433 --> 00:00:59,517
And (people) cast their vote.

20
00:01:00,310 --> 00:01:02,771
Then there is an election to decide who won.

21
00:01:02,771 --> 00:01:05,648
Whoever gets more votes will become the head...will become the head.

22
00:01:06,107 --> 00:01:09,110
Whoever has less will not be able to make it.

23
00:01:09,235 --> 00:01:10,737
Our local language is...

24
00:01:11,279 --> 00:01:12,447
SUBHASHISH PANIGRAHI: 'What is his name?'

25
00:01:12,739 --> 00:01:13,573
Bangani.

26
00:01:13,698 --> 00:01:15,408
Those who are more educated...meaning...

27
00:01:15,408 --> 00:01:16,493
..no one (speaks) Bangani...

28
00:01:16,493 --> 00:01:18,203
Nothing (is written in Bangani) on Facebook and WhatsApp.

29
00:01:18,995 --> 00:01:20,747
And (people) hear a lot...

30
00:01:20,955 --> 00:01:23,249
..very few people go and put something (in Bangani).

31
00:01:23,249 --> 00:01:26,044
We don't know about it in the village...

32
00:01:26,044 --> 00:01:27,545
..who is it, what is it...

33
00:01:29,339 --> 00:01:31,508
..Some live outside, some live in the city.

34
00:01:31,800 --> 00:01:34,511
How?...What does it mean?...I don't know.
